  "i18n": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Oni Sumo Shove!",
      "concept": "A sumo tactics puzzle on a round ring. Every oni shows its next move as a locked arrow. Beyond shoving, you dodge a charge so it runs out by itself, or make oni shove each other; reading which technique will land is the core.",
      "howToPlay": "Swipe to step; walk into an oni to shove it. Read the arrows and push every oni out of the ring.",
      "libraryDecision": "three.js: a raised 3D ring seen from above makes oni tumbling over the straw bales satisfying and keeps arrows easy to read. ZzFX for sound. No physics engine; the grid rules matter more.",
      "soundDecision": "No BGM. Wooden clappers open each bout; slaps, whooshes, heavy landings and crowd cheers celebrate each technique, and the quiet between moves is thinking time."
    }
